---
/**
 * Work page: "Before the jobs, and around them".
 * Education as two open columns, a featured dance story with photos, then a quiet row of three.
 * Kept short and understated on purpose: the jobs above are the main story, this is context.
 */
---
<section class="section container eo" id="education" aria-labelledby="eo-title">
  <h2 class="eo-title" id="eo-title">Before the jobs, and around them</h2>

  <!-- EDUCATION -->
  <div class="edu">
    <p class="label">Education</p>
    <div class="edu-row">
      <div class="school">
        <p class="kick">2022 – 25 · CHRIST University, Bengaluru</p>
        <div class="s-top"><h3>BBA Finance</h3><span class="big">3.56<small>/4.0 GPA</small></span></div>
        <p class="say">What stayed with me most was learning to turn a broad question into something I could actually test.</p>
        <p class="subj"><mark>Statistics</mark> · <mark>Econometrics</mark> · Business Analytics · Financial Modelling</p>
        <p class="research">Undergraduate research · <a href="/projects/healthcare-expenditure/">Healthcare Expenditure: A Gender-Based Analysis →</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="school">
        <p class="kick">2020 – 22 · CBSE, Class XI–XII</p>
        <div class="s-top"><h3>Maths &amp; Computer Science</h3><span class="big">96.2%</span></div>
        <p class="say">Computer Science was where Python and SQL first stopped feeling like subjects and started feeling like something I could build with.</p>
        <p class="subj"><mark>Python</mark> · <mark>SQL</mark> · <mark>Calculus</mark> · <mark>Probability</mark> · Matrices</p>
        <ul class="marks" role="list">
          <li><span class="mk"><span class="n">99</span><small>/100</small></span><em>Computer Science</em></li>
          <li><span class="mk"><span class="n">95</span><small>/100</small></span><em>Mathematics</em></li>
          <li><span class="mk"><span class="n">95.2</span><small>%</small></span><em>Class X</em></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- OUTSIDE WORK -->
  <div class="ow">
    <p class="label">Outside work</p>
    <div class="feature">
      <div class="prints">
        <figure class="print p1">
          <img src="/images/dance.webp" alt="Team Dhadak on stage: a dancer mid-spin in a pink dupatta and embroidered skirt." width="900" height="587" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          <figcaption class="hand">Team Dhadak, on stage</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="print p2">
          <img src="/images/team.webp" alt="Team Dhadak backstage: 6 team members together, 4 in white and gold costumes." width="800" height="600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          <figcaption class="hand">Team Dhadak, backstage</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
      <div class="f-text">
        <p class="kick">Dance · since 2009</p>
        <h3>15+&nbsp;years of training, 3&nbsp;years of running a team</h3>
        <p class="say">I’ve trained in <strong>Bharatanatyam</strong> since 2009 and hold the <strong>Vidwat</strong>, an advanced degree in the form. Years of practice made repetition feel less like discipline and more like the way you get good at anything.</p>
        <p class="say">At CHRIST I was dance coordinator for <strong>Team Dhadak</strong>, a 12-member inter-college team: auditions, rehearsals, formations, schedules, and the small things that decide whether a team actually runs well.</p>
        <p class="fine">7+ performances · participation up 60%</p>
        <p class="hand note">started a post-rehearsal dinner ritual. they still do it.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row3">
      <div class="mini">
        <h4>Team Snappers</h4>
        <p class="kick">Associate Head · 30+ shoots</p>
        <p class="say">More time organising who was behind the camera than being in front of it. Which is why I’m rarely in the photos.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mini">
        <h4>Youth for Parivarthan</h4>
        <p class="kick">Volunteer · 250+ hours</p>
        <p class="say">Cleaning public spaces, painting walls and serving meals across 15 Bengaluru neighbourhoods.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mini">
        <h4>A résumé side quest</h4>
        <p class="kick">For final-year students</p>
        <p class="say">Helping people put their work into words. The best part is the message afterwards: “I got the job.”</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .eo { --eo-body: #44413b; --eo-soft: #8f8a81; --eo-hl: rgba(242, 200, 75, 0.32); padding-top: clamp(110px, 10vw, 160px); }
  .eo-title { font-family: var(--font-head); font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(2rem, 1.4rem + 1.8vw, 2.8rem); line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .eo .label { font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--grey); font-weight: 600; }
  .eo mark { background: linear-gradient(transparent 62%, var(--eo-hl) 62%, var(--eo-hl) 94%, transparent 94%); color: inherit; padding: 0 0.02em; }
  .kick { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--grey); }
  .say { margin-top: 14px; font-size: 0.98rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--eo-body); max-width: 50ch; }
  .say strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
  .fine { margin-top: 14px; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--eo-soft); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

  /* education */
  .edu { margin-top: 44px; }
  .edu-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; margin-top: 18px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong); }
  .school { padding: 26px 40px 6px 0; }
  .school + .school { padding: 26px 0 6px 40px; border-left: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .s-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 16px; margin-top: 6px; }
  .s-top h3 { font-family: var(--font-head); font-weight: 400; font-size: 1.6rem; line-height: 1.15; }
  .big { font-family: var(--font-head); font-size: 1.9rem; line-height: 1; color: var(--cobalt); white-space: nowrap; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .big small { font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--grey); margin-left: 3px; }
  .subj { margin-top: 14px; font-size: 0.86rem; color: var(--ink); }
  .research { margin-top: 14px; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 0.84rem; color: var(--grey); }
  .research a { color: var(--cobalt); font-weight: 500; }
  .research a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .marks { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px 30px; margin: 16px 0 0; padding: 14px 0 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .marks li { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .mk { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 2px; }
  .mk .n { font-family: var(--font-head); font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1; color: var(--ink); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .mk small { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--grey); }
  .marks em { font-style: normal; margin-top: 6px; font-size: 0.76rem; color: var(--grey); }

  /* outside work: featured */
  .ow { margin-top: clamp(64px, 7vw, 88px); }
  .feature { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: clamp(32px, 5vw, 72px); align-items: center; margin-top: 18px; padding-top: 34px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong); }
  .prints { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 1.25; }
  .print { position: absolute; margin: 0; padding: 9px 9px 30px; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 16px 28px -18px rgba(60, 45, 20, 0.5), 0 1px 1px rgba(60, 45, 20, 0.1); }
  .print img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .print figcaption { position: absolute; left: 11px; bottom: 5px; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--grey); }
  .print::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: -10px; left: 50%; width: 70px; height: 19px; margin-left: -35px; background: rgba(226, 214, 186, 0.9); transform: rotate(-3deg); }
  .p1 { left: 0; top: 0; width: 78%; transform: rotate(-2deg); }
  .p2 { right: 0; bottom: 0; width: 48%; transform: rotate(2.5deg); }
  .f-text h3 { margin-top: 8px; font-family: var(--font-head); font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 1.3rem + 1vw, 2.1rem); line-height: 1.15; text-wrap: balance; }
  .f-text .say { margin-top: 16px; }
  .note { margin-top: 14px; width: fit-content; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--cobalt); transform: rotate(-1.5deg); transform-origin: left; }

  /* outside work: the quiet row */
  .row3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 40px; margin-top: 56px; }
  .mini { padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .mini h4 { font-family: var(--font-head); font-weight: 400; font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.2; }
  .mini .kick { margin-top: 3px; }
  .mini .say { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 0.92rem; }

  @media (max-width: 880px) {
    .edu-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .school, .school + .school { padding: 24px 0 8px; border-left: 0; }
    .school + .school { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .feature { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .prints { max-width: 520px; }
    .row3 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 26px; }
  }
</style>
